Goals: fully run this OS on my hardware

Minimum requirements:
- 64-bit
- working file system
- basic input/output (keyboard, display)
- memory management
- process management
- basic drivers (e.g., for storage, network)
- support for multitasking


GDT:
- UEFI gives us a GDT but we should set up our own anyway


